## FINAL UX INTEGRATION, PREMIUM VISUAL QA, END-TO-END WORKFLOW TESTING & CUSTOMER UAT READINESS

**Priority:** P0 — Final Frontend Product Quality Gate  
**Phase:** UX-S5 — Final Integration & Acceptance  
**Execution:** SOURCE AUDIT → INTEGRATION VERIFICATION → BROWSER TESTING → TARGETED FIXES → REGRESSION → UAT HANDOFF  
