# 1. MISSION

The 5TOT Đà Nẵng product has undergone a customer-validated simplification and UX redesign.

Previous phases include:

- SRW-1: One-time School forwarding backend.
- SRW-2: Shared Student dossier presentation.
- SRW-3: School consolidated batch forwarding UI.
- SRW-4: Simplified City and Committee workflows.
- SRW-6: Student personal profile and submitted application snapshot.
- UX-S1: Information Architecture.
- UX-S2: Simplified Review Workspace.
- UX-S3: Application Lists, Dashboard, Statistics and Excel.
- UX-S4: Administration and Award Program Navigation.

UX-S5 is the final integration and usability acceptance phase.

Do not assume these phases are complete simply because their prompts were previously issued.

Inspect the actual source and verify the actual implementation.

The objective is to eliminate fragmented UI, broken navigation, incomplete interactions, layout defects, inconsistent data, misleading statuses and role-specific workflow regressions.

**Do not implement another large redesign. Make the existing product cohesive, efficient and production-oriented.**

