# 21. SECURITY VERIFICATION

Verify negative authorization cases.

At minimum:

1. Student cannot modify another Student's dossier.
2. School Officer cannot access unrelated School Review Units.
3. UDN Reviewer sees all eight authorized member institutions but not independent Schools.
4. City Reviewer cannot perform Committee final decisions.
5. Technical ADMIN cannot perform Committee final decisions merely because of ADMIN role.
6. Committee cannot edit original Student declarations.
7. Unauthenticated users cannot view private evidence.
8. Private School decision attachments cannot be downloaded without authorization.
9. Inactive secondary roles do not grant privileges.
10. Cross-season mutations are rejected where unauthorized.
11. Stale human review mutations do not overwrite newer results silently.
12. No assignment requirement blocks valid shared City review.

Frontend tests alone cannot establish backend authorization.

Use actual available backend HTTP/security tests for server-side guarantees.

